Departure Mono

DepartureMono-Regular.otf and LICENSE are unmodified files of Departure Mono 1.500
(https://github.com/rektdeckard/departure-mono, release v1.500, DepartureMono-1.500.zip, SHA-256
bf3e48059aeef4617ec585bdea81dcc3491c576b3e7a472f52faf40e09ee5c3a).

Copyright 2022-2024 Helena Zhang (helenazhang.com). SIL Open Font License 1.1 without Reserved Font Names
(LICENSE).

ScouterKit converts the font with font_converter.py (src/README.md, "Fonts", has the command) into
src/base/departure_mono.inc: 1-bpp glyphs at 11 px as a C array (kDepartureMonoBlob). That file is a
modified version of the font under the same licence; the C++, C, Go and Python libraries and the tests
include it.
